    {
      "parameters": {
        "sendTo": "={{ $('Code — Normalize and Generate Token').item.json.email }}",
        "subject": "Your Marketing Un-Silo audit is ready. One reply needed.",
        "emailType": "html",
        "message": "=<html>\n<body style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background: #0d0d0d; color: #e0e0e0; padding: 32px; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n\n<h2 style=\"color: #1971c2; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Your audit score is in.</h2>\n\n<p>Hi {{ $('Code — Normalize and Generate Token').item.json.name || 'there' }},</p>\n\n<p>You scored <strong>{{ $('Code — Normalize and Generate Token').item.json.totalScore }}/{{ $('Code — Normalize and Generate Token').item.json.maxScore }}</strong> on the Marketing Data Audit.</p>\n\n<p>The full Marketing Un-Silo Blueprint PDF is ready to send. One step stands between you and it.</p>\n\n<div style=\"background: #1a1a2e; border-left: 4px solid #1971c2; padding: 20px; margin: 24px 0; border-radius: 4px;\">\n  <p style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 1.1em; color: #ffffff; font-weight: bold;\">Reply to this email with the single word:</p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 2em; color: #1971c2; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 0.05em;\">Ok</p>\n</div>\n\n<p>That is it. No forms. No extra clicks. When we receive your reply, we send the PDF immediately.</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: #888; font-size: 0.85em;\">We do this to filter bots, confirm real intent, and make sure the PDF reaches a real inbox. Serious operators get through in under 60 seconds.</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 0.8em; margin-top: 32px;\">Confirmation token: {{ $('Code — Normalize and Generate Token').item.json.confirmToken }}</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 0.8em;\">The Innovative Native | <a href=\"https://theinnovativenative.com\" style=\"color: #1971c2;\">theinnovativenative.com</a></p>\n\n</body>\n</html>",
        "options": {
          "replyTo": "info@theInnovativeNative.com"
        }
      },
